#### `tests/` — test_graph.py + test_contract.py

pytest, mongomock, zero network calls, fully deterministic.

**test_graph.py:** upsert node/edge, get_dependents, get_dependencies, merge_order (linear chain), merge_order (cycle → raises with path), blast_radius depth 1 and 2.

