## 06 · Technology Stack (v2.0 additions)

|Layer        |Library           |Version|Role                                      |
|-------------|------------------|-------|------------------------------------------|
|Graph        |networkx          |≥ 3.0  |DiGraph, topological sort, cycle detection|
|MCP Server   |fastmcp           |≥ 0.4  |5 typed tools, stdio transport            |
|Async DB     |motor             |≥ 3.0  |Async MongoDB driver for all graph ops    |
|Parsing      |tree-sitter       |≥ 0.21 |AST extraction, 37 languages (existing)   |
|HTTP Client  |httpx             |≥ 0.27 |GitHub API calls, async, retry logic      |
|Schemas      |pydantic          |≥ 2.0  |MCP tool input/output typing              |
|Contract Hash|hashlib           |stdlib |SHA-256, normalized, no dep               |
|Tests        |pytest + mongomock|latest |Zero network, deterministic               |

**Constraints enforced throughout:**

- Python, 4-space indent
- All MongoDB operations use motor (async)
- No placeholder methods — every method fully implemented
- `CyclicDependencyError` includes the cycle path in its message
- GitHub API calls: exponential backoff, max 3 attempts
- MCP tools return typed dicts, not raw strings
- `post_index_hook()` is async and non-blocking relative to indexing pipeline

