## 07 · Build Sequence

Build in this exact order. Each file must compile before proceeding to the next.

```
1. models.py          — shared dataclasses, no dependencies
2. graph.py           — CoordGraph, depends on models + motor + networkx
3. extractor.py       — DependencyExtractor, depends on models + graph
4. contract.py        — ContractExtractor + Differ, depends on models
5. pr_checker.py      — PRContractChecker, depends on graph + contract + httpx
6. mcp_server.py      — FastMCP server, depends on graph + contract
7. indexer_hook.py    — post_index_hook(), depends on extractor + contract + graph
8. api.py             — FastAPI router, depends on graph + pr_checker
9. tests/             — test_graph.py + test_contract.py
```

