## Summary

Codemind v1 is a **passive index** — it knows what exists.

Codemind v2.0 is an **active coordination runtime** — it knows what breaks, in what order, across repo boundaries, at the moment an agent or engineer plans a change.

That is the gap. No existing product has it. The foundation to ship it is already built.

